{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"んイヤァッ！ホオォォォ(日村さん風)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は、制作でパタパタしてるよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがたき！忙し！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、\nアルバム握手会～☆（ゝω・）v"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1回目"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/06/27/3442748/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今、話したい誰かがいる(ハーフツイン)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2回目"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/06/27/3442748/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嫉妬の権利水色(ひつじ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でした～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/06/27/3442748/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"主に、\n深川ロスについてと！\nここ最近のnogibingoや\n乃木坂工事中のお話がおおかったかな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロスりつつ、\n楽しい話もできたしちょっとエネルギー回復ｩ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/06/27/3442748/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/06/27/3442748/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりに\n握手会潜入したいぃってなってるんですが\n今野さん！まゆこさん！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アルバム特典みたひとわかるだろうけど\n過去に潜入したやつが\nまゆこの動画にあげられててびっくり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またやりたいなあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/06/27/3442748/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとね\n握手会でね\nカワゴロリきたいなあ～～っておもってる\nライブverと46時間verで服とか耳全部違うからどっちか借りれたら次の握手会あたりで着るかな～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/06/27/3442748/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/06/27/3442748/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂工事中で、\n私のお父さんの事を話したんだけど、\n本当にパワフルで、ダンスの他に沢山の趣味があって(書ききれないほど)\n今はスケボーにはまってるらしい(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の趣味を見つけて楽しんでいるお父さんの姿を見て育ったので、今の私になってると思う。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/06/27/3442748/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/06/27/3442748/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年は、父の日に靴のプレゼントをしたらすごく喜んでくれたよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔あげたマグカップは、\n社会科見学でデザインしたの！\n夜露死苦って感じがかけたのは\n我ながらすごいなあとおもってる。\n愛羅武勇(アイラブユー)とかもかいてたな。笑小学生低学年にして中二病発動してたからね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/06/27/3442748/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/06/27/3442748/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/06/27/3442748/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発売中の雑誌・BRODYさんで\nまいまいとでてます！第二ボタンもらっちゃった♡永久保存版♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして表紙がななみの\nSamuraiELOさんの美女散歩に登場してます\nななみにこのふたりが一緒に出るって面白いね～ってはなしてた！仲良しだから(o･v･)♪笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非チェックです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいぴち～"}],"source":"archive"}